    "title": "男主被刀刺却丝毫无伤，霸总掏百万现金砸脸！离谱网文批量上线，谁来管？",
    "nick_name": "人民日报",
    "author": "郑娜",
    "user_name": "gh_363b924965e9",
    "desc": "",
    "content_noencode": "<p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">　　近日，</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 18px;font-weight: bold;\">“谁来管管现在的小说”</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">话题登上热搜，不少读者晒出自己读过的离谱网文，逗乐一众网友。比如，写歹徒持刀深深刺进男主胸腔，男人却丝毫无伤，理由竟是“他的心早已提到了嗓子眼”；写霸总掏出一百万现金砸在别人脸上；写女主大量失血后不经休养，一夜之间身体完全复原……</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;mp-quote&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 18px;font-weight: bold;\">类似这样脱离常识、违背逻辑的网文桥段屡见不鲜，暴露出行业的结构性隐患。</span></span></strong></p><section><strong><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;mp-quote&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;\"><br  /></span></strong></section><section style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/FIXTURE-1.jpg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"1.7777777777777777\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"519554178\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section><section><strong><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;mp-quote&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;\"><br  /></span></strong></section><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><strong><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;mp-quote&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 18px;font-weight: bold;\">　　离谱网文批量涌现，流量导向难辞其咎。网络文学平台以点击量、追更数据作为流量分配依据，稳定日更是创作者获得收益的硬性条件。</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;mp-quote&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">要完成每日更新字数，套用所谓的“名场面”、挪用类型文烂梗、堆砌琐碎甚至低俗细节，远比花精力打磨故事成本低。这正是一些创作者放弃推敲叙事逻辑，优先追求短时爽感的重要原因。缺少内容支撑，作者便刻意制造戏剧冲突，依靠强刺激剧情和反常人设博取眼球，只要能换来点击转化、获得收益，哪管故事合不合情理。</span></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;mp-quote&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;\"><br  /></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;mp-quote&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">　　精细审核的缺位也是重要原因。传统出版模式下，编辑贯穿写作全程，深度参与故事框架构思、情节合理性推敲与细节勘误，是把控内容质量的一道重要关口。网文平台的运营逻辑则截然不同，编辑的考核更多与签约作品数量、流量表现绑定。面对海量持续更新的连载网文，编辑很难开展精细化审读，更难以兼顾叙事逻辑、人物动机与生活常识校验。因此，大量网文的逻辑漏洞、常识硬伤缺少把关与校正，直接流向读者。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;mp-quote&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;\"><br  /></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;mp-quote&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">　　AI工具降低创作门槛，则进一步放大了行业弊病。大量AI水文套用重生、复仇、霸总等叙事模板，仅仅更换人名和背景，便可生成成百上千部新作。而大模型在抓取互联网文本时，又会不断复刻网上流传的荒诞桥段，让错误情节裂变式扩散，形成“越传越错”的恶性循环，助推劣质网文野蛮生长，挤占优质网文的创作空间。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;mp-quote&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;\"><br  /></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;mp-quote&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">　　离谱网文，行文粗疏、情理不通还在其次，审美跑偏、价值错位更是大患。它不仅消耗读者的时间和精力，部分扭曲内容还会误导青少年，侵蚀网络文学健康的创作生态。此类乱象治理，不能只靠网友自发吐槽。平台细化审核标准、行业重拾“慢工出细活”的耐心、监管部门完善规则，三者缺一不可。</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 18px;font-weight: bold;\">唯有各方协同发力，引导创作者回归内容本身，方能形成兼具文学审美与价值坚守的创作风气，守护网络文学的原创活力。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;mp-quote&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;\"><br  /></span></p><p><strong><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;mp-quote&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 18px;font-weight: bold;\">　　治理离谱网文，不是限制创作自由，而是守护创作底线。</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;mp-quote&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">网文之所以吸引人，是因为它天马行空的想象力，但想象不等于乱想，虚构不等于胡编。</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;mp-quote&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 18px;font-weight: bold;\">真正的好故事，恰恰是在合理逻辑与真实情感的基础上，让读者心甘情愿地“入戏”。</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;mp-quote&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">守住常识底线、敬畏创作规律，网络文学才能走得更远。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;mp-quote&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;\"><br  /></span></p><hr style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;font-family: -apple-system-font, system-ui, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);border-style: solid;border-right-width: 0px;border-bottom-width: 0px;border-left-width: 0px;border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.098);transform-origin: 0px 0px 0px;transform: scale(1, 0.5);\"  /><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;font-family: -apple-system-font, system-ui, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">来源：人民日报客户端，作者：郑娜，</span></span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;mp-quote&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:null,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;,&quot;data-layout-id&quot;:null},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;span&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:null},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">策划：雒健晴，</span></span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;mp-quote&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:null},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;,&quot;data-layout-id&quot;:null},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;span&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:null},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">海报：王宇峰，原题《</span></span><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;,&quot;data-layout-id&quot;:null}]\">离谱网文批量上线，谁来管？</span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;mp-quote&quot;, &qu